      ],
      "source": "https://www.capenews.net/mashpee/columns/the-magnifying-glass-popponesset-as-a-resort/article_28cb7720-9cba-5153-bec9-5ea2150116c0.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Popponesset Marketplace grew from a modest shop collection into a summertime hub at Shore Drive and Great Neck Road South.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
